#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"\"Our new COO was not available on any platform. Zenith reached her through "
"their network and she accepted within 48 hours of our final interview.\""
msgstr ""

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"\"The search was highly sensitive. We needed both speed and total "
"discretion. Zenith delivered on both without question.\""
msgstr ""

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"\"They understood the political dynamics of our board before we even "
"finished the briefing. The cultural fit of our new CEO is extraordinary.\""
msgstr ""

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"\"We had tried two other firms. Zenith found our CFO in six weeks. He was "
"our first and only shortlist candidate.\""
msgstr ""

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"\"What sets Zenith apart is their refusal to pad a shortlist. We received "
"three names. All three were exceptional. We hired the best one.\""
msgstr ""

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"\"Zenith's level of market intelligence was unlike anything I'd experienced. "
"They knew our industry from the inside.\""
msgstr ""

